      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T02:25:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to implement a function that only reclaims anonymous pages. When an app is pushed to the background, the anonymous pages of the app are reclaimed:\nCall the isolate_folio function to determine whether the folio can be isolated and reclaimed.\nThe pseudocode is as follows.\nlists \u003d lrugen-\u003efolios[gen][LRU_GEN_ANON][zone];\nfor each folio lists\n\tif (isolate_folio(lruvec, folio))\n\t\tlist_add(\u0026folio-\u003elru, \u0026list_release);\n\nreclaim_pages(\u0026list_release, true);",
      "parentUuid": "422904ef_b9f022e0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4405,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4405,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "188a460740bbaad4b6a47de84fa456e8acf767e2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9c97247a_76889207",
        "filename": "mm/vmscan.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 4405,
